The Mercedes-Benz SL "Mille Miglia 417 Edition" was a special edition of the R231 generation SL, released in 2015/2016 to commemorate a racing victory in 1955. It was available on the SL 400 (later SL 450 in the US) and SL 500 (later SL 550 in the US) models. I will evaluate based on the specs of the 2016 SL 450/400 and SL 550/500 Mille Miglia 417 Edition, comparing them to today's market benchmarks.

Let's use a blend of data for the SL 400/450 and SL 500/550 versions where appropriate, focusing on the higher performance SL 500/550 specs for performance metrics as it represents a higher tier of the edition.

